msgstr "Confirmar y guardar"

msgid "Wrong day? Correct it here — otherwise I use what you said (today, yesterday…)."
msgstr "¿El día está mal? Corregilo acá — si no, uso lo que dijiste (hoy, ayer…)."

msgid "Could not read that"
msgstr "No pude leer eso"

